@startuml
actor PlatformEngineer
actor Developer
participant Console
participant DefinitionService
participant Planner
participant Executor
database Store
PlatformEngineer -> Console : save form changes
Console -> DefinitionService : expected editor version
DefinitionService -> Store : transaction: CAS editor + immutable Proposed revision
PlatformEngineer -> Console : promote default (optional)
DefinitionService -> Store : CAS policy; frozen Environments unchanged
Developer -> Console : select Environment revision
Console -> Store : scope/busy check; CAS desired snapshot
Developer -> Console : Preview
Console -> Planner : frozen desired snapshots + applied resource baselines
Planner --> Console : affected workloads, changes and migration blockers
Developer -> Console : Deploy(reviewed token)
Console -> Store : claim/fence and recheck selections
Console -> Executor : exact cached artifacts and retained tools
Executor -> Store : per-resource acknowledgements + original pins
alt complete success
 Console -> Store : fenced applied selection activation
else partial or unknown outcome
 Console -> Store : preserve previous full applied policy and actual resource Plans
end
@enduml
